      "title": "La Samaritaine",
      "description": "French department store",
      "extract": "La Samaritaine is a large department store in the first arrondissement of Paris, France. The nearest metro station is Pont-Neuf. Established in 1870 by Ernest Cognacq, it is now owned by the luxury goods conglomerate LVMH.",
